---
// DEPRECATED — /waitlist now redirects into the app's signup.
//
// The waitlist existed while early access was a queue you applied to join. It
// is not one any more: the site is live, signup is self-serve and the trial
// starts the moment you finish it, so an application form promising to be in
// touch is the wrong destination for anyone who lands here from an old link,
// a bookmark or a search result.
//
// 301, not 302: the form is not coming back, so search engines should drop the
// URL and pass any accumulated signal to the destination.
//
// Server-rendered (prerender = false) so this is a real HTTP redirect. A
// prerendered page could only manage a meta-refresh, which flashes the dead URL
// and is not a redirect search engines honour.
//
// Still here, deliberately: the submitted applications in Neon and the admin
// viewer at /admin/waitlist that reads them. Deprecating the form does not mean
// destroying the entries people took the time to fill in.
import { registerUrl } from '@/lib/appLinks';

export const prerender = false;

return Astro.redirect(registerUrl('en'), 301);
---
